stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> DECLARED
    DECLARED --> COLLECTING: freeze intent
    COLLECTING --> TRACEABLE: all AC + changes + artifacts + approval match
    COLLECTING --> BLOCKED_MISSING: acceptance/change/artifact missing
    COLLECTING --> BLOCKED_LINK: one-way or wrong reverse link
    COLLECTING --> BLOCKED_IDENTITY: intent/context/commit mismatch
    COLLECTING --> BLOCKED_RELEASE: approval missing or owner mismatch
    BLOCKED_MISSING --> COLLECTING: collect new evidence
    BLOCKED_LINK --> COLLECTING: rebuild trace bundle
    BLOCKED_IDENTITY --> DECLARED: create new intent for new commit
    BLOCKED_RELEASE --> COLLECTING: obtain explicit approval
    TRACEABLE --> VERIFY: immutable report
    VERIFY --> RELEASE_GATE: behavior and release checks
    RELEASE_GATE --> [*]
